003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApril J\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e","bg_star_color":"#c8c8c8","star_color":"#00b67a","star_symbol_color":"#ffffff","stars_rating":5,"text":"\u003cp\u003eThis blanket is so soft! It’s cozy, and it doesn’t get too hot.\u003c/p\u003e","title":"Best Blanket Ever"},"type":"column"},"column_hmgeLr":{"settings":{"author":"\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRamon\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e","bg_star_color":"#c8c8c8","star_color":"#00b67a","star_symbol_color":"#ffffff","stars_rating":5,"text":"\u003cp\u003eThese blankets are amazing! I have bought 3 and I don’t think I’ll ever be able to go back to any other kind. They keep me cool at night and I don’t have to fight for my side of the blanket because they’re so big. They’re very soft and feel slightly weighted but probably because of the size.\u003c/p\u003e","title":"5 Stars"},"type":"column"},"column_kY8BXf":{"settings":{"author":"\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eJessie P\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e","bg_star_color":"#c8c8c8","star_color":"#00b67a","star_symbol_color":"#ffffff","stars_rating":5,"text":"\u003cp\u003eThese blankets are the absolute best\u003c/p\u003e","title":"Best fuzzy ever"},"type":"column"},"column_mpzd3U":{"settings":{"author":"\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCheryl D\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e","bg_star_color":"#c8c8c8","star_color":"#00b67a","star_symbol_color":"#ffffff","stars_rating":5,"text":"\u003cp\u003eLove my blanket. Not too hot or cold, best blanket purchase yet\u003c/p\u003e","title":"Love my"},"type":"column"},"column_nfBnNr":{"settings":{"author":"\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDerek H\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e","bg_star_color":"#c8c8c8","star_color":"#00b67a","star_symbol_color":"#ffffff","stars_rating":5,"text":"\u003cp\u003eI've been wanting to get one of these since seeing it at a friend's house, \u0026 I'm obsessed. I'm 6'2\", \u0026 no blanket is ever really big enough. This thing goes on for days, it's incredible.\u003c/p\